	"_a8": "Combined arms A8 (cg_brief queue item 2.6; docs/combined_arms.md 2.9.2, 2.4.5), Proposed. ammo: what a round costs, by data/shells.json id (2.9.2's list: M829A3 1,100, M830A1 800, M1147 900; M791 45, M919 70, M792 30 a round; TOW 9,000; Mk19 40; .50 M33 6, M8 API 9); a round item's price in items is per_item x its round (a 25 mm can of 50 M791 is 2,250), a pallet's its load plus 300 for the pallet; the motor pool's rearm at the FOB charges the main-gun, autocannon and TOW rounds and the smoke salvos it puts in at these (MG belts stay a free top-up, as since 2026-10-14). packages: what each armour package costs at the motor pool (2.4.5; the MaxxPro applique 40,000, cg_brief 2.0), refunded half when removed; the Bradley M919 package is free (its rounds are paid per round). The 125 mm and 30 mm rounds are the enemy's, found in their racks: sold, never bought.",
